00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,930
Right answer. Wrong path. Grade how your agent got there.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:10,260
Three illustrative runs, all with the right answer. Run one used the right tools. Run two took fourteen steps for a three-step job. Run three emailed a customer by mistake.

3
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:19,930
Grade the trajectory: the right tool with the right arguments, a step count close to expected, and no risky action without approval. Log every step, and review bad paths even when the answer passed.

4
